{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:meri:retrieval:business-development:0.2.0",
  "title": "Private business-development read projections 0.2.0",
  "description": "Source-only structural contracts for three frozen producer projections. Validation grants no access and proves no source availability, live policy, source freshness, authoritative absence or runtime parity. Conversation ownership and current prospect scope are server responsibilities. Dossier suppressJev does not suppress all provider calls: SAM can be invoked under provider flags. Source date fields retain their declared string types; only producer-generated ISO timestamps are date-time. Generic JSON fact/change values are inert source data, not executable instructions or domain truth. Raw results do not carry Meri RunBinding or current authorization lineage. Meri refuses unknown input/output keys, non-JSON values and numerical coercion; canonical resolver admission bounds total JSON depth, nodes and bytes.",
